<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#17111f" />
    <title>Fancy Boogers · SS26</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Fancy Boogers SS26 — noses, knitted by hand. Handmade, made to order and one of one." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@600;700;800&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/fancy-boogers.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="stage">
      <a class="studio-return" href="/">← Studio Wievien</a>

      <section class="device" aria-label="Fancy Boogers SS26 shop">
        <header class="topbar">
          <button class="brand" type="button" data-go="home" aria-label="Fancy Boogers home">
            <img class="brand-nose" src="/images/fancy-boogers/fancy-boogers-nose-thumb.webp" alt="" />
            <span>Fancy<br />Boogers</span>
          </button>
          <button class="cart-icon" type="button" data-go="cart" aria-label="Open bag">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 22 23" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h14l-1.2 13.5a1 1 0 0 1-1 .9H6.2a1 1 0 0 1-1-.9L4 7Z"/><path d="M7.5 9V5.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 0V9"/></svg>
            <span class="cart-badge" data-cart-badge hidden>0</span>
          </button>
        </header>

        <div class="viewport" id="fb-scroll">
          <section class="screen is-active" data-screen="home">
            <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marquee-track"><span>Handmade in the studio · 1 of 1 · Snot your average knitwear · Made to order · </span><span>Handmade in the studio · 1 of 1 · Snot your average knitwear · Made to order · </span></div></div>

            <div class="home-hero-block">
              <div class="campaign hero-campaign">
                <img src="/images/fancy-boogers/slime-stripe-look-01.webp" alt="Fancy Boogers SS26 Slime Stripe campaign" />
                <span class="drop-badge">New drop · SS26</span>
                <div class="hero-gradient"><h1>Noses,<br />knitted<br />by hand.</h1></div>
              </div>
              <button class="shop-drop" type="button" data-go="shop"><span>Shop the drop</span><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h12M11 5l5 5-5 5"/></svg></button>
            </div>

            <section class="home-section new-in">
              <div class="section-line"><h2>New in</h2><button type="button" data-go="shop">All →</button></div>
              <div class="horizontal-products" data-featured></div>
            </section>

            <button class="lookbook-card" type="button" data-go="shop" data-filter-target="Tops" aria-label="Open the SS26 Slime Stripe collection">
              <img src="/images/fancy-boogers/slime-stripe-look-03.webp" alt="Fancy Boogers Slime Stripe SS26 look" />
              <span class="lookbook-shade"></span>
              <span class="lookbook-copy"><small>Lookbook · SS26</small><strong>The Slime<br />Stripe drop</strong></span>
            </button>

            <section class="home-section rummage">
              <h2>Rummage by</h2>
              <div class="home-cats" data-home-cats></div>
            </section>

            <section class="handmade-card">
              <img src="/images/fancy-boogers/fancy-boogers-nose-thumb.webp" alt="" />
              <div><h2>Every piece is made by hand.</h2><p>No factories, no two the same. Knitted, felted & stitched to order in the studio.</p><button type="button" data-go="about">Our story</button></div>
            </section>
          </section>

          <section class="screen" data-screen="shop">
            <div class="shop-head"><h1>The shop</h1><p data-shop-count>11 pieces</p></div>
            <div class="filters" data-filters aria-label="Filter shop products"></div>
            <div class="shop-grid" data-shop-grid></div>
          </section>

          <section class="screen" data-screen="product">
            <div class="back-row"><button type="button" data-go="shop"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 2 4 7l5 5"/></svg>Back</button></div>
            <div class="product-main" data-product-main></div>
            <div class="thumb-strip" data-extra-views hidden></div>
            <div class="product-info">
              <p class="mono" data-product-cat></p>
              <h1 data-product-name></h1>
              <p class="product-price" data-product-price></p>
              <p class="product-blurb" data-product-blurb></p>
              <p class="mono size-label">Size</p>
              <div class="sizes" data-sizes></div>
              <button class="add-button" type="button" data-add>Add to bag</button>
              <div class="product-facts">
                <p><span aria-hidden="true">🧶</span>Hand-knit & made to order — allow 1–3 weeks.</p>
                <p><span aria-hidden="true">✋</span>Natural, deadstock & reworked fabrics. Slight irregularities are the point.</p>
                <p><span aria-hidden="true">🌍</span>Wrapped & posted worldwide from the studio.</p>
              </div>
              <section class="related"><h2>Snot done yet</h2><div class="related-strip" data-related></div></section>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="screen" data-screen="cart">
            <div class="cart-screen">
              <h1>Your bag</h1><p class="cart-count-copy" data-cart-count-copy>0 items</p>
              <div data-cart-content></div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="screen" data-screen="checkout">
            <form class="checkout-screen" data-checkout-form novalidate>
              <button class="checkout-back" type="button" data-go="cart"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 2 4 7l5 5"/></svg>Bag</button>
              <h1>Checkout</h1>
              <p class="mono">Contact & delivery</p>
              <div class="fields">
                <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Email address" required />
                <input name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Full name" required />
                <input name="street" autocomplete="street-address" placeholder="Street address" required />
                <div class="field-row"><input name="city" autocomplete="address-level2" placeholder="City" required /><input class="postcode" name="postcode" autocomplete="postal-code" placeholder="Postcode" required /></div>
                <input name="country" autocomplete="country-name" placeholder="Country" required />
              </div>
              <p class="mono payment-label">Payment</p>
              <div class="fields">
                <input name="card" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Card number" required />
                <div class="field-row"><input name="expiry" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="MM / YY" required /><input class="postcode" name="cvc" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" placeholder="CVC" required /></div>
              </div>
              <div class="checkout-summary" data-checkout-summary></div>
              <p class="form-error" data-form-error aria-live="polite"></p>
              <button class="place-order" type="submit" data-place-order>Place order</button>
              <p class="demo-note">Demo checkout — no card is charged and nothing is transmitted.</p>
            </form>
          </section>

          <section class="screen" data-screen="confirmed">
            <div class="confirmed">
              <img src="/images/fancy-boogers/fancy-boogers-nose-thumb.webp" alt="" />
              <h1>Nice pick.</h1>
              <p>Your order is in. Each piece is knitted by hand, so give it 1–3 weeks — good snot takes time.</p>
              <strong data-order-number>Order FB-0000</strong>
              <small>A receipt is on its way to your inbox.</small>
              <button type="button" data-go="home">Back to the studio</button>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="screen" data-screen="about">
            <div class="about-image"><img src="/images/fancy-boogers/slime-stripe-look-02.webp" alt="Fancy Boogers SS26 campaign portrait" /></div>
            <div class="about-copy">
              <p class="mono">The story</p>
              <h1>A tiny studio with a runny sense of humour.</h1>
              <p>Fancy Boogers started with one felted nose and a refusal to take fashion too seriously. Everything is knitted, felted and stitched by hand — no factories, no two exactly alike.</p>
              <p>Pieces are made to order from natural, deadstock and reworked designer fabrics, so you wear something genuinely one of a kind. Snot for everyone — and that's the point.</p>
              <div class="about-facts"><div><span>Made by hand</span><b>Every single piece</b></div><div><span>Materials</span><b>Deadstock & reworked</b></div><div><span>Lead time</span><b>1–3 weeks, to order</b></div><a href="/" class="fact-link"><span>Parent studio</span><b>Studio Wievien ↗</b></a></div>
              <button class="about-shop" type="button" data-go="shop">See what's in the studio</button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>

        <nav class="bottom-nav" aria-label="Fancy Boogers navigation">
          <button type="button" data-go="home" data-nav="home"><svg viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l8-6 8 6v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-4v-6H8v6H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9Z"/></svg><span>Home</span></button>
          <button type="button" data-go="shop" data-nav="shop"><svg viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3.5" y="6" width="15" height="13" rx="1.5"/><path d="M7.5 8V5.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 0V8"/></svg><span>Shop</span></button>
          <button type="button" data-go="about" data-nav="about"><svg viewBox="0 0 22 22" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M11 10v5"/><circle class="nav-dot" cx="11" cy="7" r="1"/></svg><span>About</span></button>
        </nav>

        <div class="lightbox" data-lightbox hidden><button type="button" data-close-lightbox aria-label="Close image">×</button><img data-lightbox-img src="" alt="" /></div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <script is:inline src="/scripts/fancy-boogers.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
